Football Players and Scouts Data Collection
This repository contains datasets related to African football, focusing on players and scouts.
Datasets Overview
1. Football Players Dataset

Source: Scraped from TransferMarket, Sofascore, and FootballAPI
File: Football_Players_Data.csv
Description: Contains information about African football players, including:
Player profiles
Positions
Performance metrics (e.g., goals, assists)
Market value
Club affiliations



2. Football Scouts Dataset

Source: Custom data collection from scouting networks
File: Football_Scouts_Data.csv
Description: Contains information about football scouts operating in African football, including:
Scout profiles
Scouting regions
Expertise areas (e.g., youth talent, positional specialties)
Years of experience
Contact information



File Structure
datasets+notebooks_by_fatma/
├── soccer_players_processed.csv
└── scouts_dataFinal.csv

Data Generation & Collection Methods

Players data: Scraped from TransferMarket, Sofascore, and FootballAPI to compile comprehensive player information.
Scouts data: Compiled from scouting networks and professional football databases.

Usage
These datasets are part of the TacticSence Phoenix project, aimed at advancing African football analytics through player and scout insights.
